title: The heralds Top reads as "Jeff replied" say only that someone forked.
pid: b2c3abf5-4234-4755-920e-cbea25c12df4
body: |2-
  My scratch reply put '1S 1O' on a message in Top's view, exactly as
  Jeff's replies do. Any teammate who answers a message there looks
  like Jeff. 'C-c l s' names the subscriber; nothing on the headline
  does. Reading Jeff's fork, above, has no such doubt.
